        "11": {
          "id": "11",
          "name": "notes.md",
          "contents": "Movie Post Decision Logic\n\nThe Question: Should I post above the movie?\n\n---\n\nPath Outcomes\nTrace each path from Level 1 and describe what happens.\n\nPath 1: Finished movie + post contains spoilers\n> \n\nPath 2: Finished movie + post does NOT contain spoilers\n> \n\nPath 3: Did NOT finish movie + post contains spoilers\n> \n\nPath 4: Did NOT finish movie + post does NOT contain spoilers\n> \n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "11",
        "2"
